      "category": "trust",
      "reason": "Development and the isolated test process may use loopback HTTP SaaS Budget Grant trust roots while retaining the same asymmetric verifier, claims, scope, amount, and failure contracts."
    },
    {
      "id": "pilot-gateway-loopback-network",
